  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Look from one eye to the other in a mirror. Why can't you normally catch the movement?",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.975,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.e522a50de999fbb06bd74569621b5296b233c93762cc15c76455ddf3e4e7b1ae",
        "sha256": "e522a50de999fbb06bd74569621b5296b233c93762cc15c76455ddf3e4e7b1ae"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-2",
      "transcript": "Now record your eyes, and watch it back. There it is.",
      "start": 5.3,
      "duration": 3.575,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.75141069e96fedb1e6d554644546271be6b9f49ca8d1be141c4b10b038e83485",
        "sha256": "75141069e96fedb1e6d554644546271be6b9f49ca8d1be141c4b10b038e83485"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Each quick jump is a saccade.",
      "start": 9.2,
      "duration": 2.35,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.fa5da6e470e748e298e25890bdf871aa04ec0c72887b0f17ffa9574341a84d2e",
        "sha256": "fa5da6e470e748e298e25890bdf871aa04ec0c72887b0f17ffa9574341a84d2e"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-4",
      "transcript": "In the mirror, the eyes you're watching are also the eyes doing the looking.",
      "start": 11.766666666666667,
      "duration": 4.5,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.08071f83aaff9b437f6c99343da1dec5ad2d0c0ef78d823e1eb2ba47e14ba5d2",
        "sha256": "08071f83aaff9b437f6c99343da1dec5ad2d0c0ef78d823e1eb2ba47e14ba5d2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-5",
      "transcript": "As they turn, the image sweeps across the retina.",
      "start": 16.533333333333335,
      "duration": 3.55,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.906c9f2f898cceae448dc10e8661e11b1db2bbc505c8a8fae525e600cd5bbc79",
        "sha256": "906c9f2f898cceae448dc10e8661e11b1db2bbc505c8a8fae525e600cd5bbc79"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Visual sensitivity drops around the movement. That's saccadic suppression.",
      "start": 20.366666666666667,
      "duration": 4.95,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.81dfd0ebae0dbf90baaca6391900ed7de9794b4d9ebe0781a8b2d0360597b879",
        "sha256": "81dfd0ebae0dbf90baaca6391900ed7de9794b4d9ebe0781a8b2d0360597b879"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-7",
      "transcript": "The clear views before and after can also mask the brief blur.",
      "start": 25.6,
      "duration": 4.175,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.c222fba06a9780fc9e427dd4226c5f5d12f87fedaee33dcc7b6fe1015ee05303",
        "sha256": "c222fba06a9780fc9e427dd4226c5f5d12f87fedaee33dcc7b6fe1015ee05303"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-8",
      "transcript": "You aren't completely blind. These effects help keep vision stable.",
      "start": 30.066666666666666,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.ad26511fc57cf2b10b140f34dcb2a7607b7a068198ed4b258a5e244ed4e84b14",
        "sha256": "ad26511fc57cf2b10b140f34dcb2a7607b7a068198ed4b258a5e244ed4e84b14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-9",
      "transcript": "Watching a recording later separates the movement from your own eye turn.",
      "start": 34.733333333333334,
      "duration": 4.65,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.f4532afa0ae60acd47ffec7ffa1e20950b11c7d9367fe228b094fd916e0ae329",
        "sha256": "f4532afa0ae60acd47ffec7ffa1e20950b11c7d9367fe228b094fd916e0ae329"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mirror-eyes-cue-10",
      "transcript": "The mirror never stopped showing it. Your visual system normally keeps the sweep out of awareness.",
      "start": 39.7,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.7a49a0de882491593aa8e8dd2544eda4f396aab3c49e6077c3a7e773dd5722ec",
        "sha256": "7a49a0de882491593aa8e8dd2544eda4f396aab3c49e6077c3a7e773dd5722ec"
      }
    }
  ],
